WEBVTT

1
00:00:05.640 --> 00:00:11.064
On the wedding day, the bride is the busiest, most on-edge person in the world.

2
00:00:11.400 --> 00:00:20.880
If her parents get makeup at the same shop, she ends up having to manage everything from logistics to whether they're happy with the result.

3
00:00:21.216 --> 00:00:28.968
But booking the parents separately at a specialist lets the bride focus entirely on her own look,

4
00:00:29.304 --> 00:00:37.848
and knowing her parents are being treated like the stars and getting ready comfortably at a specialist puts her mind at ease.

5
00:00:38.184 --> 00:00:50.112
And hearing her parents say, "Thanks to you, I got so many compliments today," is the greatest reward and act of filial devotion a bride can feel.
